{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/PreferenceKit\/documentation\/PreferenceKit\/UsingPreferenceKit","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/PreferenceKit\/documentation\/PreferenceKit"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/preferencekit\/usingpreferencekit"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"PreferenceKit"}],"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Using PreferenceKit","role":"article"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Add a settings screen","anchor":"Add-a-settings-screen","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass your app’s privacy policy, support email, changelog, acknowledgements, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"social-media profiles to "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/PreferenceKit\/documentation\/PreferenceKit\/PreferenceKit","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". Supply "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for an optional item"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to hide it. "},{"code":"changeLog","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"acknowledgements","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" are required parameters so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"call site makes that choice explicit."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiftUI","import PreferenceKit","","struct SettingsView: View {","    var body: some View {","        PreferenceKit(","            createdBy: \"[Example Studio](https:\/\/example.com)\",","            privacyPolicyURL: URL(string: \"https:\/\/example.com\/privacy\"),","            supportEmail: \"support@example.com\",","            socialMediaLinks: [","                .init(platform: .github, profile: \"example\"),","                .init(platform: .website, profile: \"https:\/\/example.com\")","            ],","            changeLog: [","                .init(version: \"1.0\", text: \"Initial release\")","            ],","            acknowledgements: [","                .init(","                    name: \"Example Dependency\",","                    copyright: \"Example Authors\",","                    licence: \"MIT\"","                )","            ],","            topContent: { EmptyView() },","            bottomContent: { EmptyView() }","        )","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"text":"Configure social-media links","anchor":"Configure-social-media-links","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/PreferenceKit\/documentation\/PreferenceKit\/SocialMediaLink","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" values with a service and a profile identifier."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PreferenceKit builds the destination URL for each supported service. A complete"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"HTTP or HTTPS URL is kept as-is, which is useful for invitation and workspace"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"links."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let links: [SocialMediaLink] = [","    .init(platform: .github, profile: \"example\"),","    .init(platform: .mastodon, profile: \"@example@mastodon.social\"),","    .init(platform: .discord, profile: \"https:\/\/discord.gg\/example\")","]"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"text":"Add custom sections","anchor":"Add-custom-sections","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"code":"topContent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"bottomContent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" view builders to add app-specific"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"settings before or after PreferenceKit’s built-in sections."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["PreferenceKit(","    changeLog: nil,","    acknowledgements: nil",") {","    Section(\"Preferences\") {","        Toggle(\"Send diagnostics\", isOn: $sendsDiagnostics)","    }","} bottomContent: {","    Section {","        Text(\"Example App\")","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The top section appears after the update information and before the built-in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"application details. The bottom section appears after developer links. Use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"standard SwiftUI controls, and provide their accessibility labels and hints as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you would in any settings form."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Supply support information","anchor":"Supply-support-information","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Setting "},{"code":"supportEmail","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" adds a Feedback button. PreferenceKit gathers the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"available log text before presenting the system mail composer. If the device"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cannot send mail, it opens a prefilled "},{"code":"mailto:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" URL instead. Give users a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"support address that you monitor."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"createdBy","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" supports Markdown, so you can credit a person or organization with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a link:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["PreferenceKit(","    createdBy: \"[Example Studio](https:\/\/example.com)\",","    changeLog: nil,","    acknowledgements: nil,","    topContent: { EmptyView() },","    bottomContent: { EmptyView() }",")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"text":"Add a roadmap","anchor":"Add-a-roadmap","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set "},{"code":"roadmapURL","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to the URL of a JSON file to show planned features and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"feedback in the app. The file must contain an array of "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/PreferenceKit\/documentation\/PreferenceKit\/RoadmapItem","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" values."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Dates use ISO 8601 timestamps, and the JSON keys use "},{"code":"snake_case","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["PreferenceKit(","    roadmapURL: URL(string: \"https:\/\/example.com\/roadmap.json\"),","    changeLog: nil,","    acknowledgements: nil",")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each roadmap item includes an integer "},{"code":"id","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"title","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"description","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"state","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"comments","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"opened_date","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"last_updated","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"code":"tags","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". For example:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"json","code":["[","  {","    \"id\": 1,","    \"title\": \"Export settings\",","    \"description\": \"Let people export their preferences as a file.\",","    \"state\": \"open\",","    \"comments\": [\"This is being considered for a future release.\"],","    \"opened_date\": \"2026-01-15T10:00:00Z\",","    \"last_updated\": \"2026-02-02T14:30:00Z\",","    \"tags\": [\"export\", \"settings\"]","  }","]"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"text":"Privacy policy behavior","anchor":"Privacy-policy-behavior","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"code":"privacyPolicyURL","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is present, PreferenceKit adds a Privacy Policy row."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"On platforms and OS versions that support the packaged web view, selecting the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"row presents the policy in-app. Otherwise, it opens the policy in the system"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"browser. The in-app reader also has a toolbar button that opens the same URL in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the system browser."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Privacy permissions","anchor":"Privacy-permissions","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Privacy framework integrations are separated into opt-in package products:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"PreferenceKitCamera","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"PreferenceKitMicrophone","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"PreferenceKitPhotos","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"PreferenceKitLocation","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"PreferenceKitContacts","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"PreferenceKitCalendar","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"PreferenceKitReminders","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"PreferenceKitSpeechRecognition","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"PreferenceKitNotifications","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Import only products for protected APIs your app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"uses, then pass their capability values through "},{"code":"privacyPermissions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; this keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unused protected APIs out of the final app binary."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import PreferenceKit","import PreferenceKitCamera","","PreferenceKit(","    changeLog: nil,","    acknowledgements: nil,","    privacyPermissions: [.camera]",")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PreferenceKit checks the host app’s "},{"code":"Info.plist","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" only for capabilities supplied"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through "},{"code":"privacyPermissions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". A selected Camera, Microphone, Photos, Location,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contacts, Calendar, Reminders, or Speech Recognition capability appears when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its usage description is nonempty. When at least one selected capability is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"available, PreferenceKit adds a Privacy destination that shows the declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reason and, on supported platforms, a Change button that opens the relevant"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Settings page. Notifications have no "},{"code":"Info.plist","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" usage-description key and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"appear whenever "},{"code":".notifications","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is supplied. Each detail view reads and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"displays the current authorization state without showing a permission prompt."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add purpose strings to the consuming app target’s "},{"code":"Info.plist","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not to PreferenceKit. App Store Connect analyzes the final app binary, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"linked privacy API can require its corresponding key even when the app has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not requested access yet. Each value must truthfully explain the feature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that uses the protected data."}]}],"style":"important","name":"Important","type":"aside"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Capability"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Info.plist key"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Example purpose string"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Camera"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSCameraUsageDescription"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"This app uses the camera to scan receipts."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Microphone"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSMicrophoneUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"This app uses the microphone to record voice notes.","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Photos"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"This app lets you attach photos to entries.","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Location"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"This app uses your location to show nearby events.","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Contacts"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSContactsUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"This app lets you choose contacts to invite.","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Calendar"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"This app adds events to your calendar.","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reminders"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSRemindersFullAccessUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"This app creates reminders for your tasks.","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Speech Recognition"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"This app transcribes spoken event titles.","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"PreferenceKitNotifications","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" does not require a purpose string. Include it only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when your app requests or presents notification authorization."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add "},{"code":"NSMicrophoneUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" as well when speech recognition captures"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"live audio. Localize these strings with the app target’s "},{"code":"InfoPlist.strings","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Do not add a generic or inaccurate value solely to silence App Store Connect;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"remove the sensitive API from the final app instead when the feature is not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offered."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To add app-specific privacy information, use the "},{"code":"privacyContent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" closure."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Supply a single row, "},{"code":"Section","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"code":"Group","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; custom content also makes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Privacy destination available when the app has no detected permissions."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["PreferenceKit(","    changeLog: nil,","    acknowledgements: nil,","    privacyContent: {","        Section(\"Privacy choices\") {","            NavigationLink(\"Data controls\") {","                Text(\"Choose how Example App uses your data.\")","            }","        }","    }",")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"text":"Next steps","anchor":"Next-steps","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For supported profile formats and the public configuration models, see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:Configuration"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Create a settings screen by configuring ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/PreferenceKit\/documentation\/PreferenceKit\/PreferenceKit","type":"reference"},{"text":" with your app’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"support and legal information.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://PreferenceKit/documentation/PreferenceKit/SocialMediaLink":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/PreferenceKit\/documentation\/PreferenceKit\/SocialMediaLink","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SocialMediaLink"}],"url":"\/documentation\/preferencekit\/socialmedialink","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"SocialMediaLink","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SocialMediaLink"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A link to a social media profile displayed in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PreferenceKit"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"doc://PreferenceKit/documentation/PreferenceKit":{"title":"PreferenceKit","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build a consistent SwiftUI settings screen with support, legal, and developer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"information."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/PreferenceKit\/documentation\/PreferenceKit","url":"\/documentation\/preferencekit","type":"topic"},"doc://PreferenceKit/documentation/PreferenceKit/RoadmapItem":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/PreferenceKit\/documentation\/PreferenceKit\/RoadmapItem","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RoadmapItem"}],"url":"\/documentation\/preferencekit\/roadmapitem","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"RoadmapItem","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RoadmapItem"}],"abstract":[{"text":"RoadmapItem represents an item in a tracking system with details such as title, description, ","type":"text"},{"text":"\n","type":"text"},{"text":"comments, dates, tags, and state.","type":"text"}]},"doc://PreferenceKit/documentation/PreferenceKit/PreferenceKit":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PreferenceKit","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PreferenceKit"}],"abstract":[{"text":"PreferenceKit Settings View","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/PreferenceKit\/documentation\/PreferenceKit\/PreferenceKit","url":"\/documentation\/preferencekit\/preferencekit","title":"PreferenceKit"}}}